        "created_at": "2021-07-29T23:39:07.147Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"fjur\" data-post=\"20\" data-topic=\"28703\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/fjur/48/4849_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> fjur:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>You should check out <a href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/t/bringdebbieback-the-scp/17847\">SCP-3231, created by our very own </a> <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/takewalker\">@TakeWalker</a>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Oh my. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/open_mouth.png?v=12\" title=\":open_mouth:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":open_mouth:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> I’m blush.</p>\n<p>Funnily, I’ve just gotten back into SCP in the last few days after yet another hiatus.</p>",
